-- either. Review Required gets no agent assignment at all (Admin Only),
-- matching the existing "(Admin Only)" segments' own convention.
--
-- Dedup, run before any insert here (never silently dropped - see the
-- session's own verification): 25 rows already matched an existing
-- call_list_leads or leadgen_leads record by phone, email, or business
-- name + city (mostly the existing Winnipeg Painting Companies segments -
-- this scraper's own "Home Renovation" search overlaps painting/general
-- contractors) and are not re-inserted; 7 rows were exact re-scrape
-- duplicates of another row already in this same file and are likewise
-- not re-inserted (only the first occurrence of each survives, and it's
-- the one that lands in Review Required). Net: 301 CSV rows -> 269 new
-- call_list_leads rows (77 No Website + 185 Website Review + 7 Review
-- Required).
--
-- extra_fields on every inserted row preserves every other column from
-- the original CSV (ratings, ad/pixel flags, social links, etc.)
-- verbatim, exactly like a real "Upload Call List" admin action would.







